Read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root before making any changes.
Never open PRs or feature branches (commit straight to `main`). Classify every finding across all 10 classes (`bug`, `error`, `issue`, `problem`, `concern`, `dilemma`, `conflict`, `gap`, `hole`, `blindspot`). Never fabricate citations, metrics, or proof claims.
